s, engine and thruster effects, and cybernetic glow lighting options.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/everspace-2-galactic-edition", "videos": [{"id": 160791, "video_id": "IyqtuegHJBk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IyqtuegHJBk", "title": "EVERSPACE\u2122 2 | Launch Trailer [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/IyqtuegHJBk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 160792, "video_id": "pOgQGxccTGY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pOgQGxccTGY", "title": "EVERSPACE\u2122 2 | Release Date Announcement Trailer [GOG]", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/pOgQGxccTGY/sddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 160793, "video_id": "7Cg77T0VLfk", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Cg77T0VLfk", "title": "EVERSPACE\u2122 2 | Game in Development Release Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/7Cg77T0VLfk/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 192753, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "wPw6dbCXcGA", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wPw6dbCXcGA", "title": "EVERSPACE 2 | Galactic Edition \u2014 Switch 2 Launch Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wPw6dbCXcGA/fhddefault.jpg"}]}